{"headword":"בָּעַר","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>vb.</strong> burn, consume <strong>(</strong>𝔗 <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּעַר</span> <em>burn;</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">ܒܥܰܪ</span> <em>seek out, collect, glean;</em> this apparently earlier meaning<strong>)</strong>—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"Pf. 3 fs. <span dir=\"rtl\">בָּֽעֲרָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 11:3\" href=\"/Numbers.11.3\">Nu 11:3</a> + 2 times, <span dir=\"rtl\">וּבָֽעֲרָה</span> consec. <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 10:17\" href=\"/Isaiah.10.17\">Is 10:17</a> + 3 times, <span dir=\"rtl\">בָּֽעֲרוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Judges 15:14\" href=\"/Judges.15.14\">Ju 15:14</a> + 2 times + <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 22:13\" href=\"/II_Samuel.22.13\">2 S 22:13</a> (but cf. De on <a data-ref=\"Psalms 18\" href=\"/Psalms.18\">ψ 18</a>), <span dir=\"rtl\">וּבָֽעֲרוּ</span> consec. <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 1:31\" href=\"/Isaiah.1.31\">Is 1:31</a>; Impf. <span dir=\"rtl\">יִבְעַר</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 3:3\" href=\"/Exodus.3.3\">Ex 3:3</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 2:12\" href=\"/Psalms.2.12\">ψ 2:12</a>, etc.; Pt. <span dir=\"rtl\">בֹּעֵר</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 3:2\" href=\"/Exodus.3.2\">Ex 3:2</a> + 6 times, <span dir=\"rtl\">בֹּעֵרָ֑ה</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 34:9\" href=\"/Isaiah.34.9\">Is 34:9</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">בּוֹעֵרָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Hosea 7:4\" href=\"/Hosea.7.4\">Ho 7:4</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">בֹּעֲרָ֫ה</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 30:33\" href=\"/Isaiah.30.33\">Is 30:33</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">בֹּעֶ֫רֶת</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 20:9\" href=\"/Jeremiah.20.9\">Je 20:9</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">בֹּעֲרוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 1:13\" href=\"/Ezekiel.1.13\">Ez 1:13</a>;—<em>burn</em>,"},{"senses":[{"definition":"(intr.) specif. <em>begin to burn, be kindled</em> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 18:9\" href=\"/Psalms.18.9\">ψ 18:9</a> sq. <span dir=\"rtl\">מִן</span> (subj. <span dir=\"rtl\">גֶּחָלִים</span>) = <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 22:9\" href=\"/II_Samuel.22.9\">2 S 2